
---
const days = [
  { day: "月", am: "院長・副院長", pm: "院長" },
  { day: "火", am: "院長・副院長", pm: "院長" },
  { day: "水", am: "院長・副院長", pm: "院長" },
  { day: "木", am: "院長", pm: "休診" },
  { day: "金", am: "院長・副院長", pm: "院長" },
  { day: "土", am: "院長・副院長", pm: "休診" },
  { day: "日", am: "休診", pm: "休診" },
];
---

<section class="clinic-calendar">
  <h2>診療時間・担当医</h2>
  <p>通常の診療担当</p>

  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>時間帯</th>
          {days.map((d) => <th>{d.day}</th>)}
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th>午前</th>
          {days.map((d) => <td>{d.am}</td>)}
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>午後</th>
          {days.map((d) => <td>{d.pm}</td>)}
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note">
    日曜・祝日は原則休診です。
    休日当番や臨時の診療変更は別途お知らせします。
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .clinic-calendar {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }

  .clinic-calendar h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .table-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 700px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: center;
  }

  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 14px 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  thead th {
    background: #f3f5f1;
  }

  tbody th {
    background: #f8f8f8;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
